{"task_id": "LABOR_059", "task_type": "fact_application", "difficulty": "hard", "jurisdiction": "CN", "applicable_date": "2024-06-01", "prompt": "公司要裁掉30人，占职工总数15%，直接发通知让下周走人。经济性裁员在程序上有什么要求？ 请基于2024年6月1日适用的法律，先检索法规，再给出简洁的结论、必要条件和条文ID；如信息不足，请指出缺失事实，不得编造。", "gold_article_ids": ["labor_contract_law:41"], "gold_issues": ["经济性裁员", "程序", "优先留用"], "expected_answer_points": ["裁减20人以上，或不足20人但占职工总数10%以上的，需提前三十日向工会或全体职工说明情况并听取意见", "裁减方案应向劳动行政部门报告", "应优先留用较长期限固定期限合同、无固定期限合同、家庭无其他就业人员等人员"], "missing_facts": [], "qualification": "", "source_evidence": [{"article_id": "labor_contract_law:41", "law_title": "中华人民共和国劳动合同法", "version_id": "2c909fdd678bf17901678bf74d7106b3@cc22abe848675f05", "effective_from": "2013-07-01", "source_url": "https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf74d7106b3", "text_sha256": "77672228ad4adb8ebdaec775b8cf6aefba26a0944ec72b40e94090e0598e78e0", "supporting_quote": "提前三十日向工会或者全体职工说明情况"}], "review": {"source_anchor_verified": true, "review_method": "assistant_manual_substantive_review_plus_programmatic_exact_quote_matching", "independent_human_legal_expert_review": "pending", "intended_use": "RL pilot; not legal advice"}, "split": "test"}
