{"task_id": "LABOR_069", "task_type": "multi_article", "difficulty": "medium", "jurisdiction": "CN", "applicable_date": "2024-06-01", "prompt": "仲裁裁决书下来后，公司说是终局裁决。我作为劳动者还能去法院起诉吗？期限多久？ 请基于2024年6月1日适用的法律，先检索法规，再给出简洁的结论、必要条件和条文ID；如信息不足，请指出缺失事实，不得编造。", "gold_article_ids": ["labor_dispute_arbitration_law:47", "labor_dispute_arbitration_law:48"], "gold_issues": ["终局裁决", "起诉期限"], "expected_answer_points": ["追索劳动报酬、工伤医疗费、经济补偿或赔偿金，不超过当地月最低工资标准十二个月金额的争议，以及执行国家劳动标准在工作时间、休息休假、社会保险等方面的争议，为终局裁决", "劳动者对终局裁决不服的，可自收到裁决书之日起十五日内向人民法院提起诉讼"], "missing_facts": [], "qualification": "", "source_evidence": [{"article_id": "labor_dispute_arbitration_law:47", "law_title": "中华人民共和国劳动争议调解仲裁法", "version_id": "2c909fdd678bf17901678bf64f28039d@e4265f037eb39107", "effective_from": "2008-05-01", "source_url": "https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf64f28039d", "text_sha256": "143f89617179df9992fec3aaad1c26e42f508d89167e8c18963fb254ae885e57", "supporting_quote": "仲裁裁决为终局裁决"}, {"article_id": "labor_dispute_arbitration_law:48", "law_title": "中华人民共和国劳动争议调解仲裁法", "version_id": "2c909fdd678bf17901678bf64f28039d@e4265f037eb39107", "effective_from": "2008-05-01", "source_url": "https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf64f28039d", "text_sha256": "408edf9c5433b37b83ba37994296417f38072575cba5c4ac5b36b0fb1fa36600", "supporting_quote": "自收到仲裁裁决书之日起十五日内向人民法院提起诉讼"}], "review": {"source_anchor_verified": true, "review_method": "assistant_manual_substantive_review_plus_programmatic_exact_quote_matching", "independent_human_legal_expert_review": "pending", "intended_use": "RL pilot; not legal advice"}, "split": "test"}
